","Epidemiology plays a crucial role in community health assessment by providing the scientific foundation for understanding and managing the health of a particular group of individuals. It involves the systematic study of patterns, causes, and consequences of disease and disease-related factors within a given period and time. This knowledge is crucial for identifying health problems, evaluating interventions, and developing effective control strategies.

