   \[
   \frac{342 \text{ mg}}{0.5 \text{ mg/kg/min}} = 684 \text{ min}
   \]

4. **Convert minutes to hours (optional):**
   \[
   684 \text{ min} \times \frac{1 \text{ hr}}{60 \text{ min}} = 11.4 \text{ hr}
   \]

Thus, the dose should be administered for $\boxed{684 \text{ min}}$ (or 11.4 hours).
