Where:
- \(\nu_f\) and \(\nu_r\) are the stoichiometric coefficients for the products and reactants, respectively.
- \(S_f\) and \(S_r\) are the molar entropies of the products and reactants, respectively.

For the given reaction:

\[
2 \text{PbS(s)} [91.2] + 3 \text{O}_2(g) [205.1] \rightarrow 2 \text{PbO(s)} [66.5] + 2 \text{SO}_2(g) [248.2]
\]

