3. Microstructure: The sintering process and grain growth are directly related to the overall microstructure of the TiO2 nanotubes. Si doping can lead to changes in the porosity, grain size distribution, and overall crystallinity of the nanotubes. These changes can have significant effects on the material's mechanical, optical, and electronic properties.

