   \[
   \text{Number of wireless mice} = 80 - 20 - 20 = 40
   \]

3. **Find the ratio of wireless mice to total mice:**  
   \[
   \text{Ratio of wireless mice to total mice} = \frac{40}{80} = \frac{1}{2}
   \]

