The gate capacitance \(C_j\) is given by:

\[
C_j = \frac{1}{C_j} = \frac{1}{2 \pi \varepsilon_0 \varepsilon_s}
\]

where:
- \(\varepsilon_0 = 8.854 \times 10^{-12} \text{ F/m}\) (permittivity of free space)
- \(\varepsilon_s = 3.3\) (relative permittivity of silicon)
- \(t_{ox} = 500 \text{ Å} = 500 \times 10^{-10} \text{ m}\) (oxide thickness)

