   \]  

Thus, the typical range of outcomes for measurements of the Σ⁺ rest energy would be:  
\[
1385 \, \text{MeV} - 3.313 \, \text{MeV} \leq E \leq 1385 \, \text{MeV} + 3.313 \, \text{MeV}
\]  
or:  
\[
1381.687 \, \text{MeV} \leq E \leq 1387.313 \, \text{MeV}
\]  

